 "summary": "Terraform's infrastructure-as-code language: HCL syntax plus Terraform-defined block types (resource, data, variable, output, module, locals), meta-arguments (count, for_each, depends_on), a built-in function library and a plan/apply evaluation model over a dependency graph and state. OpenTofu is a community fork.",
